{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00033",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 8.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "Hi doctor, um, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.55,
      "end_seconds": 14.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.36,
      "end_seconds": 18.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Good morning, um, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.76,
      "end_seconds": 21.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.4,
      "end_seconds": 32.28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.88,
      "text": "So the thing is, you know, I've got blood on the toilet paper. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.5,
      "end_seconds": 35.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.52,
      "end_seconds": 42.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "So, about... well, five days. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.3,
      "end_seconds": 47.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.06,
      "end_seconds": 51.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Well, um, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.57,
      "end_seconds": 56.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "What about pain when you pass stool, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.13,
      "end_seconds": 70.65,
      "duration_seconds": 13.52,
      "text": "Yes, I have. With pain when I pass stool, a five out of ten, I suppose. I've also had an itchy bottom, since yesterday. Right, I've also had constipation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.02,
      "end_seconds": 75.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Has there been any family history of bowel cancer?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.63,
      "end_seconds": 78.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No. No family history of bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.4,
      "end_seconds": 80.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.54,
      "end_seconds": 84.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "No, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 84.61,
      "end_seconds": 88.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.84,
      "end_seconds": 95.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Um, um, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.76,
      "end_seconds": 104.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any black stools, weight loss or abdominal pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.35,
      "end_seconds": 110.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "I haven't had black stools, weight loss or abdominal pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.2,
      "end_seconds": 113.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.99,
      "end_seconds": 116.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.65,
      "end_seconds": 119.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.38,
      "end_seconds": 125.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "My mother has migraines. My father had a heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.89,
      "end_seconds": 129.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Alright, has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.97,
      "end_seconds": 144.74,
      "duration_seconds": 14.77,
      "text": "Um, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.71,
      "end_seconds": 150.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.31,
      "end_seconds": 158.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Yes, ibuprofen. I get stomach pain. Eggs. I come out in... well, a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.25,
      "end_seconds": 163.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.29,
      "end_seconds": 175.0,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "I've had low haemoglobin for about ten years now. I've got high blood pressure. I've had thin bones, yes. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.33,
      "end_seconds": 187.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "Okay, low haemoglobin, that's already on your record. Good to know. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. So, are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.74,
      "end_seconds": 204.82,
      "duration_seconds": 16.08,
      "text": "Iron tablets, once a day for my blood count. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. Telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. Alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 208.31,
      "end_seconds": 215.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the alendronate was 35 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.36,
      "end_seconds": 219.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.16,
      "end_seconds": 223.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I, I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.54,
      "end_seconds": 225.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.65,
      "end_seconds": 229.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.54,
      "end_seconds": 232.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.83,
      "end_seconds": 236.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I had my tonsils out when I was a child."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.11,
      "end_seconds": 241.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.66,
      "end_seconds": 252.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.13,
      "end_seconds": 278.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 85 beats a minute, saturation 99 percent, pressure 112 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.22,
      "end_seconds": 280.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.32,
      "end_seconds": 288.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.6,
      "end_seconds": 303.58,
      "duration_seconds": 13.98,
      "text": "Oh, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.38,
      "end_seconds": 307.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.64,
      "end_seconds": 311.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "So, stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.81,
      "end_seconds": 331.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "There's a small external pile at the edge, and I don't see any fissure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.11,
      "end_seconds": 333.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.38,
      "end_seconds": 350.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Tummy is soft and non-tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.1,
      "end_seconds": 353.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.54,
      "end_seconds": 375.62,
      "duration_seconds": 17.08,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.74,
      "end_seconds": 382.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Oh, um, thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.98,
      "end_seconds": 400.27,
      "duration_seconds": 16.29,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is haemorrhoids. I'd also keep an anal fissure in mind. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blood on the toilet paper for five days, moderate, and no abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.83,
      "end_seconds": 403.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.17,
      "end_seconds": 407.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Alright, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.74,
      "end_seconds": 408.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.16,
      "end_seconds": 448.83,
      "duration_seconds": 24.67,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I'd like to arrange a colonoscopy for rectal bleeding. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. We should do blood tests for rectal bleeding. I'll start you on a soothing cream, twice a day, for one week. It's for haemorrhoids. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.14,
      "end_seconds": 471.88,
      "duration_seconds": 21.74,
      "text": "Soak in a warm bath for ten minutes after you pass stool, and don't strain. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'll also refer you to a colorectal surgeon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 472.79,
      "end_seconds": 479.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 481.21,
      "end_seconds": 482.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 483.79,
      "end_seconds": 493.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "If you pass a lot of blood or feel faint, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 494.99,
      "end_seconds": 498.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 499.41,
      "end_seconds": 506.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Alright, just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 507.78,
      "end_seconds": 511.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "So, I come back in three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 512.59,
      "end_seconds": 517.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 518.67,
      "end_seconds": 521.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}